    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 270-8
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7683933"
    >
Existing installations.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7683933" data-guid="7683933"></div>
        <div id="questions-7683933" data-guid="7683933" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7683933_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Unless the certification and permit process is complied with as called for herein, all existing public pay telephones installed prior to the effective date of this chapter shall be removed by the owner within 30 days thereof.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7683934"
      id="7683934"
